column4:
The Independents
(prev. Labour Co-op
and Change UK){{efn|name=Berger|Berger quit Labour in February 2019 to join The Independent Group (later Change UK), before quitting to become an independent MP in June 2019. The following month, she founded The Independents with four other MPs.}}

column20:
Birkenhead Social
Justice Party
(prev. Labour){{efn|Field quit Labour in February 2019 to join The Independent Group (later Change UK), before quitting to become an independent MP in June 2019. Two months later, he founded his own party, the [[Birkenhead Social Justice Party]].}}
